[{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020900_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020900_01_0010","text":"──────♪"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020900_01_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020900_01_0020","text":"果穗，看起来心情很好啊\n遇到什么好事了吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020900_01_0022","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020900_01_0030","text":"是的！\n……啊，还没到！是待会儿才有！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020900_01_0040","text":"晚上要和大家一起玩！\n我带扑克牌来了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020900_01_0050","text":"哦哦，不错嘛！\n不过，可别熬夜哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020900_01_0060","text":"好的！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020900_01_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020900_01_0070","text":"（咦，游戏室好安静啊……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020900_01_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020900_01_0080","text":"（果穗，睡着了吗……\n　白天那么努力，应该是累了吧）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020900_01_0090","text":"（她待会儿是要和大家一起玩吗？\n　总之先……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020900_01_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020900_01_0100","text":"啊，你是来拿毯子的吗\n我也正想去拿────"}]
